# Local working journal
journal.md

# Claude Code config.
# Track ONLY the skills this repo OWNS — `alarmist` and `comparator-benchmark`; every
# other skill here is a vendored copy from es_xenium / spatial_analysis_skills — see
# .claude/skills/VENDORED.md.
# The leading `!.claude/` is needed to override `/.claude/` in .git/info/exclude.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/alarmist/
!.claude/skills/comparator-benchmark/
!.claude/skills/VENDORED.md
!.claude/skills/LICENSE.spatial_analysis_skills
